{"2134530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Odyssey of Dremid'ir", "steam_appid": 2134530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4008980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient, dormant world, and an epic RPG adventure waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN EPIC STORY UNFOLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/17f67828b3881ad76c91d842cd59f4c0.poster.avif?t=1777048313\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/17f67828b3881ad76c91d842cd59f4c0.webm?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/17f67828b3881ad76c91d842cd59f4c0.mp4?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>DREMID’IR</strong>, the godly beings that once shepherded their creation have been slain. In their place, destruction and darkness. But NEW civilizations have grown to blaze their own paths forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join an UNLIKELY group of heroes, on a quest to PROTECT New Bastion, and destroy THE GODSLAYER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choose between three of six party members, and cutscenes will CHANGE based on who you bring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPEN WORLD EXPLORATION<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/59ffbe55beaa7b52a94d593d286e7f3b.poster.avif?t=1777048313\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/59ffbe55beaa7b52a94d593d286e7f3b.webm?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/59ffbe55beaa7b52a94d593d286e7f3b.mp4?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OPEN WORLD EXPLORATION, that lets you discover powerful TREASURE, ingredients for ALCHEMY, and QUESTS to embark on. Highly personal storylines will bring you close to endearing heroes, and nefarious villains alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACTIVE TURN BASED COMBAT</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/af81632b276bc95a42470dc119b2ecea.poster.avif?t=1777048313\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/af81632b276bc95a42470dc119b2ecea.webm?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/af81632b276bc95a42470dc119b2ecea.mp4?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REAL TIME COMBAT, with 6 unique party members, whose abilities all interact differently with each other. Conquer over 15 BOSS BATTLES in your journeys across Dremid’ir. Slay dozens of foes, from mutants, to human enemies, using FIRE, ICE, MAGNETISM, SWORDS, BOWS, DAGGERS, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR HOUSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/95fcc553da9f9d33ac2c19c9821129a8.poster.avif?t=1777048313\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/95fcc553da9f9d33ac2c19c9821129a8.webm?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/95fcc553da9f9d33ac2c19c9821129a8.mp4?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your home base to rest and relax. Customize your house to your liking with items gathered through your adventures, and gain special party bonuses as a reward!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient, dormant world, and an epic RPG adventure waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN EPIC STORY UNFOLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/17f67828b3881ad76c91d842cd59f4c0.poster.avif?t=1777048313\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/17f67828b3881ad76c91d842cd59f4c0.webm?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/17f67828b3881ad76c91d842cd59f4c0.mp4?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <strong>DREMID’IR</strong>, the godly beings that once shepherded their creation have been slain. In their place, destruction and darkness. But NEW civilizations have grown to blaze their own paths forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join an UNLIKELY group of heroes, on a quest to PROTECT New Bastion, and destroy THE GODSLAYER.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choose between three of six party members, and cutscenes will CHANGE based on who you bring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OPEN WORLD EXPLORATION<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/59ffbe55beaa7b52a94d593d286e7f3b.poster.avif?t=1777048313\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/59ffbe55beaa7b52a94d593d286e7f3b.webm?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/59ffbe55beaa7b52a94d593d286e7f3b.mp4?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OPEN WORLD EXPLORATION, that lets you discover powerful TREASURE, ingredients for ALCHEMY, and QUESTS to embark on. Highly personal storylines will bring you close to endearing heroes, and nefarious villains alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACTIVE TURN BASED COMBAT</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/af81632b276bc95a42470dc119b2ecea.poster.avif?t=1777048313\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/af81632b276bc95a42470dc119b2ecea.webm?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134530/extras/af81632b276bc95a42470dc119b2ecea.mp4?t=1777048313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REAL TIME COMBAT, with 6 unique party members, whose abilities all interact differently with each other. Conquer over 15 BOSS BATTLES in your journeys across Dremid’ir. 